  "commands": 39,
  "count_scope": "Separate per-cell ABI6 prefix after reap, possibly partial. Reason gates observe only actual short-circuit evaluations. Exact means recorded source key and context equality, not generated-layout, claim or permission reuse authority. Sixteen-retirement misses are censored. Retirement rank includes duplicate publications and is not LRU distance or a cache-hit prediction. Offer age counts offers since retirement, in bins1/2/3-4/5-8/9-16/17-64/65-256/over256. When source matches without any full context match, bank/registry/lifetime deltas describe only the newest exact source match. Pre-offer refusals are outside the reason bank; linked ingress is not every kernel trap. No absent terminal is invented.",
